  "outcome": [
    "Existing run_workflow advertises object-shaped source/input/idempotencyKey/optional hostId input, while strict registered-envelope callers remain supported.",
    "Actor-bound daemon workflowSources context supplies host/repository/assignment/base/runtime profile; missing or ambiguous context fails before source access.",
    "Trusted .workflow.ts and static relative imports compile via existing esbuild into immutable content-addressed modules; dependency bytes and compiler version participate in identity.",
    "Server-only @codex/workflows/source keeps compiler dependencies out of ordinary authoring bundles; unchanged CLI L2 passed after this boundary correction.",
    "Existing PostgreSQL/pg-boss workflow execution resolves source artifacts after restart; App Server executes mixed-profile agents without per-workflow configuration.",
    "Source-root containment, malformed source, unbound dynamic imports, artifact tampering, replay conflict and separate intentional run keys are covered.",
    "Built plugin still lists nine tools and exposes source properties; no manual digest calculation, JavaScript preparation, or individual workflow registration is required by the author."
